WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.700
Welcome back, champ!

2
00:00:04.700 --> 00:00:17.290
Unit 1 · What Is AI? · done!

3
00:00:17.290 --> 00:00:22.510
Unit 2 · How Machines Learn

4
00:00:22.510 --> 00:00:28.260
Chapter 1 · Teaching a Computer Like a Puppy

5
00:00:28.260 --> 00:00:35.380
A puppy and a computer? Let's find out!

6
00:00:35.380 --> 00:00:44.500
Meet Kabir and his puppy, Laddoo!

7
00:00:44.500 --> 00:00:51.790
Kabir says it once: "Sit!"

8
00:00:51.790 --> 00:00:58.980
Laddoo just chases her tail!

9
00:00:58.980 --> 00:01:07.110
Why didn't Laddoo learn? Think!

10
00:01:07.110 --> 00:01:15.190
Puppies need many tries, not just one

11
00:01:15.190 --> 00:01:24.110
1 · Show: gently help her sit

12
00:01:24.110 --> 00:01:34.110
2 · Praise: "Good dog!" and a treat

13
00:01:34.110 --> 00:01:46.790
3 · Practise: many tries, then she's got it!

14
00:01:46.790 --> 00:01:52.330
We teach a computer in a similar way!

15
00:01:52.330 --> 00:02:01.380
Show the AI lots and lots of cat photos

16
00:02:01.380 --> 00:02:12.480
Right? Say yes! Wrong? Say no.

17
00:02:12.480 --> 00:02:23.440
More practice → better guesses. Not magic!

18
00:02:23.440 --> 00:02:31.330
Photo + name sticker = a labelled example

19
00:02:31.330 --> 00:02:38.460
Lots of labelled examples = TRAINING

20
00:02:38.460 --> 00:02:46.410
Not a train ride! Teaching with examples.

21
00:02:46.410 --> 00:02:53.710
You be the teacher! Say yes or no.

22
00:02:53.710 --> 00:03:09.020
The AI says "cat" both times. Yes or no?

23
00:03:09.020 --> 00:03:21.410
Cat: yes! Dog: no! That helps it learn.

24
00:03:21.410 --> 00:03:29.960
Train with just ONE orange cat photo

25
00:03:29.960 --> 00:03:41.700
Black cat? The AI says "not a cat"! Why?

26
00:03:41.700 --> 00:03:52.050
It thinks all cats are orange! One isn't enough

27
00:03:52.050 --> 00:03:58.960
Black · White · Stripy · Big · Tiny

28
00:03:58.960 --> 00:04:11.240
Many cats → it learns what all cats share

29
00:04:11.240 --> 00:04:29.880
Which set teaches "cat" best?

30
00:04:29.880 --> 00:04:39.560
100 different cats wins!

31
00:04:39.560 --> 00:04:50.390
Step 1 · TRAIN: lots of labelled examples

32
00:04:50.390 --> 00:04:59.430
Step 2 · TEST: a new photo, see its guess

33
00:04:59.430 --> 00:05:14.510
Wrong? Train with more, then test again

34
00:05:14.510 --> 00:05:18.460
Your turn: practice check

35
00:05:18.460 --> 00:05:31.950
Teach "bus": 1 photo or 100? Why?

36
00:05:31.950 --> 00:05:51.410
100! Many kinds → it learns what buses share

37
00:05:51.410 --> 00:05:56.080
Training = showing lots of examples

38
00:05:56.080 --> 00:05:59.030
Labelled examples have their names on

39
00:05:59.030 --> 00:06:03.420
One example is not enough

40
00:06:03.420 --> 00:06:06.130
First train, then test

41
00:06:06.130 --> 00:06:14.870
Chapter 1 done!

42
00:06:14.870 --> 00:06:21.670
Next: Quiz · Tap Finish
